Drivefin
========

An unofficial Jellyfin client for the BMW iDrive 7 (MGU) head unit. Not affiliated with or endorsed by the
Jellyfin project or BMW AG. Jellyfin is the Jellyfin project's software and name; BMW and iDrive are trademarks
of BMW AG. No Jellyfin or BMW artwork, logo or code is in this repository.

This repository has parts under different licences:

  apps/clucraft_jellyfin/, tools/, test/, docs/, the files at the root    MIT (LICENSE)
  native/clucraft-jellyfin/, native/tvh-player/                           GPL-3.0-or-later (their own LICENSE files)
  kit/                                                                    MIT (kit/LICENSE.idrive7-apps, kit/LICENSE.nickgcode)

The app (MIT) and the service (GPL) are separate programs that talk over a socket.

What it is built on
-------------------

clucraft/plex-idrive ("Drive-In")  https://github.com/clucraft/plex-idrive
    This project's sibling for Plex, and what Drivefin is made from: the app (main.js, store.js, ui.js,
    drivegate.js; MIT), the service (service.js, client.js, session.js, hls.js, art.js; GPL-3.0-or-later), the
    tools and the tests, with Jellyfin in place of Plex. What that is built on is listed below, as it is there.

M850i-amn/idrive7-apps  https://github.com/M850i-amn/idrive7-apps  (commit 0dfa583151e0c59ba8d2a8d9272a1d8685b66d2a)
    Copyright (c) 2026 M850i-amn. Its IPTV app is the model for this one.
    - kit/: its copy of the MGU App Kit (below), unchanged: the build script, the app runtime it packs into the
      app, the permissions template. kit/UPSTREAM.json names the commit.
    - apps/clucraft_jellyfin/svc.js, caraudio.js, fullview.js: from apps/amn_iptv/lib (svc.js, car_audio.js,
      fullview.js), MIT. main.js follows amn_iptv's main.js in how it wires the kit, the full view and the video.
    - native/clucraft-jellyfin/tvh-player: the binary of its IPTV service, unchanged (sha256 40b6d540...d709d05f);
      native/tvh-player/: that binary's source, unchanged. GPL-3.0-or-later.
    - native/clucraft-jellyfin/player.js, netx.js, sockgroup.js, check.js, systemd/: from native/amn-iptv, with this
      tool's names. GPL-3.0-or-later.

